•	Minimum 2 years of experience in events administration, event operations or a related field;
•	Strong organisational and multi-tasking abilities;
•	Strong communication and interpersonal skills;
•	Good stakeholder management and collaborative working skills; and
•	Ability to multi-task and work effectively as part of a team.

